hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1511","I am Ahmad bin Sinan Al-Wasiti and Ali bin Al-Mundhir. They said: Abdullah bin Numayr told us, on the authority of Ubayd Allah, on the authority of Nafi’, on the authority of Ibn Umar. “When the immigrants came to the city, they camped next to Quba, and prayer was attended. Their mother was Salem, the servant of Abu Hudhayfah, and he was the largest of them. Qur’an. Among them are Omar ibn al-Khattab and Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Asad.” This is the hadith of Ahmad ibn Sinan."
